I am sitting at my desk.
I look at my computer screen.
The screen is very bright.
I am working on a new project.
It is a long document.
I am typing fast.
This work is difficult.
I am reading the document carefully.
My colleague Prakash is sitting near me.
He is also working on the computer.
The office is very quiet now.
I am checking everything again.
Finally, I finish the work.
I am saving the file.
Now the document is ready.
I close the computer window.
I am smiling now.
I feel very relieved.
